Created Jun 24, 2023, 03:09PM::md .update
Summary::md .summary
  We currently spam a bunch of add column and rows when the paste is out of
  bounds.

  That is pretty inefficient. It would be better to do them as a single larger
  message.

  We could also combine them into a single message.

  We could also have a composite message type that is a list of a bunch of
  messages. That would easily add it as a single transaction, but it would bloat
  the message size over the wire. idk.

  We could also just have the front/backend insert columns for a paste when
  needed. That would be even less info.

Punted Jan 13, 2024, 10:53AM::md .update
  Meh whatever.
